    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάκτορον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>king's dwelling, palace,</i> in
