					43
				</span></i>
			: pl., ib.<i><span class="en">
				117
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				757
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐν Ἐλευσῖνι ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.65
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
